Frontend

The frontend provides an interactive and user-friendly interface that allows users to access the AI Crop Yield Prediction system through a web browser. It is designed to offer a responsive and seamless experience across different devices.

### Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Bootstrap

Frontend Features

- Responsive and attractive user interface
- User Registration and Login pages
- Crop details input form
- Validation of user inputs
- Prediction result display
- Navigation menu for easy access
- Mobile-friendly design

Frontend Modules

- **Home Page** – Provides an introduction to the application.
- **Login Page** – Allows registered users to securely log in.
- **Registration Page** – Enables new users to create an account.
- **Crop Prediction Page** – Collects crop and environmental details from the user.
- **Prediction Result Page** – Displays the predicted crop yield.
- **Contact/About Page** – Provides project information and contact details.

 Responsibilities

- Collect user input through web forms.
- Validate input before sending it to the backend.
- Send requests to the Spring Boot REST APIs.
- Display prediction results received from the backend.
- Provide an easy-to-use and responsive interface.

